% M2-L8 control, scene 3 of 3: THE SAME-NODE-COUNT VARIANT.
%
% No spectators, and x and y one value wider. Measured 2026-09-18, against the base:
%
%     nodes 9 = 9          <-- identical, and this is the whole point
%     decisions 5 -> 4, maxdepth 5 -> 4, skipped 2 -> 0, learned 4 -> 5
%
% A report keying CHANGED on the node count alone -- which is exactly what this harness
% did between M1-T36 and M2-L8 -- classifies this row `proof-only` or `same` and invites
% the reader to compare its bytes and its seconds as though one search had been written
% down two ways. Two different searches were run. The expected verdict is CHANGED, and
% it is reachable only from `decisions`, `maxdepth` and `skipped`.
%
% Widths are 4 and 2 (D-0028).
var 0..4: x :: output_var;
var 0..4: y :: output_var;
constraint int_ne(x, y);
constraint int_eq(x, y);
solve satisfy;
